  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For the past two months I've had others tell me my cloning was on, when in my menu it was unchecked and I never turn it on. The only way to fix it is checking  and unchecking the box as soon as I log in. \nThe other day someone cloned my avatar while it showed as unchecked in my menu.\n\nThank you for reading, I hope this is fixed as soon as possible since I purchase my avatars from Booth.",
